Note 1: The air speed at which the decision is made to commit the aeroplane to a landing or to go-around should normally be the best SE rate of climb speed and in any case not less than the safety speed.
Note 2: On no account should instrument approach ‘decision height’ and its associated procedures be confused with the selection of minimum height for initiating a go-around in asymmetric power flight.
